ets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/70","description":"It hides food under its long body hair. However, it forgets it has hidden the food."},{"id":"pl2-71","localId":"71","name":"Nidoran ♀","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/71","description":"While it does not prefer to fight, even one drop of the poison it secretes from barbs can be fatal."},{"id":"pl2-72","localId":"72","name":"Nidoran ♂","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/72","description":"It scans its surroundings by raising its ears out of the grass. Its toxic horn is for protection."},{"id":"pl2-73","localId":"73","name":"Nidorina","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/73","description":"When it senses danger, it raises all the barbs on its body. These barbs grow slower than NIDORINO's."},{"id":"pl2-74","localId":"74","name":"Nidorino","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/74","description":"It has a violent disposition and stabs foes with its horn, which oozes poison upon impact."},{"id":"pl2-75","localId":"75","name":"Nuzleaf","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/75","description":"The sound of its grass flute makes its listeners uneasy. It lives deep in forests."},{"id":"pl2-76","localId":"76","name":"Quagsire GL","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/pl2/76"},{"id":"pl2-77","localId":"77","name":"Sealeo","variants":{"normal":true,"holo":false,"reverse":true,"firstEdition":false,"wPromo":false},"image":"https://assets.tcgdex.net/en/pl/p